<title>UK: IADB adds 500 mln Czech crowns to one-year bond.</title>
<headline>IADB adds 500 mln Czech crowns to one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been</p>
<p>increased by 500 million Czech crowns to 2.0 billion Czech</p>
<p>crowns, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTER-AMERICAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT   *2.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     11.0	MATURITY    15.JAN.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.79    PAY DATE    15.JAN.98</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0	 REOFFER    99.94     SPREAD	+=</p>
<p> NOTES	ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED 03.JAN.97 AT 100.73</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 25	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.85	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
